</div></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_364a6189-3085-9092-5f2e-fccba8485fc2-fea1d617" class="col"><div class="rich-text-wrapper"><div class="rich-text w-richtext"><p><strong>Game details</strong></p>
<p>Perth Wildcats 105 defeat Cairns Taipans 76</p>
<p>Cairns Convention Centre</p>
<p><a href="https://fibalivestats.dcd.shared.geniussports.com/u/NBL/2116381/bs.html">Box Score</a></p>
<p>10 October 2022</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Summary</strong></p>
<p>The Perth Wildcats absolutely shot the lights out in their first road game of NBL23. Milestone man Todd Blanchfield dropped four three-pointers in the first quarter, finishing with five threes overall, while Jesse Wagstaff managed four threes coming off the bench. The Wildcats finished with 18 three-pointers for the game, the most threes scored in an away game in club history. It was also the first time Perth have scored 100+ point in Cairns since 2008. After trailing by 1 point after the first quarter, the Wildcats put their foot on the pedal and overran the Taipans, getting the lead out to 30 points throughout the game.</p>
<p><strong>Reaction</strong></p>
<p>John Rillie on how he thought the game went.</p>
<p>"As you've seen from us in the pre-season, we had different guys injured at different times, that was no different to tonight and everyone stepped up and as you saw, statistically, we had a lot of contributors across the board, it was all about our mentality and how we wanted to approach it."</p>
<p>Todd Blanchfield on celebrating his 350<sup>th</sup> game with a win.</p>
<p>"I'm very fortunate to see 350 games in this league, it's a very good league and to see where it was, to where it is now, it's pretty special to be a part of."</p>
<p><strong>Player focus</strong></p>
<p>Bryce Cotton starred with with a game-high 24 points, 7 rebounds and 3 assists.</p>
<p><strong>Next game</strong></p>
<p>Perth Wildcats return to Perth to face Melbourne United on Friday night at RAC Arena. <a href="https://bit.ly/WildcatsTix23">Get tickets!</a></p></div></div><div class="tags-wrapper"><p class="bold-text">Tags</p><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="hide w-dyn-empty"><div>No items found.</div></div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="hide w-dyn-empty"><div>No items found.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-wf--section---advertising--variant="base" class="section"><div class="container"><div aria-label="go to member page" class="advertising dimension-auto bottom-padding-3em"><div class="w-embed w-script"><script>
